            <ArticleTitle>Rehabilitation of the athlete's shoulder.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>821-31</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.csm.2008.07.001</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Optimal shoulder function is achieved through segmental activation along the kinetic chain. Alterations within the kinetic chain often contribute to shoulder injury. Therefore, a multi-factorial approach to shoulder rehabilitation, where the causes of shoulder pain as well as site of symptoms, should be implemented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
